{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>These are the statutes and the judgments which you shall observe, etc., to possess it all the days.</b> And the sum of these commandments is that you must observe them — for through their observance you shall possess the land all the days: that you destroy every place of idolatrous worship and that you not act like them toward the blessed El, to offer before Him in any place, and that there be for you a designated place to offer before Him — that place which HaShem your Elohim shall choose from all your tribes."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:21:14.857158402Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}